Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Sudah sampai!\N- Hei, Remi! Tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.44,0:00:28.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku duluan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.98,0:00:31.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Astaga. Sikapnya jadi mirip laki-laki.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.24,0:00:42.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari siapa dia mewarisi sifat itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.50,0:00:45.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari makan!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.25,0:00:49.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayah, ini enak.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.35,0:00:51.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Makanlah yang banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.74,0:00:52.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.55,0:01:00.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kukira bunga sakura sudah bermekaran.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.17,0:01:02.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belum waktunya.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.39,0:01:06.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa tempatnya jadi seperti ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.11,0:01:08.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tenang saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.67,0:01:10.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku yakin air terjun itu\Nakan muncul kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.97,0:01:12.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari dulu sudah ada air terjun, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.27,0:01:16.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang airnya cuma sedang beristirahat.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.57,0:01:17.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, kau benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.87,0:01:20.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Enak.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.82,0:01:22.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tahu tidak, kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.42,0:01:24.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena ayahmu jago memasak?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.25,0:01:27.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.58,0:01:31.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ibu bilang, kalau makan di sini\Nsemuanya pasti terasa enak.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.18,0:01:39.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, mari kita kembali\Nsaat bunga sakura bermekaran.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.14,0:01:41.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.80,0:03:40.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serius? Lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.89,0:03:43.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar kumpulan pecundang. Merepotkan saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.43,0:03:47.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya mereka memantau aksi kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.93,0:03:50.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti ada anggota Momotaro\Nyang punya kemampuan melacak.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.31,0:03:54.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jumlah mereka sekitar 50 orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.24,0:03:58.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk standar unit pemburu,\Nmereka gigih juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.69,0:04:01.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian para pria, jangan menatapku.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.29,0:04:06.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya, jangan mendekat.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.19,0:04:08.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar kulawan mereka sendirian.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.47,0:04:11.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian adalah Brigade Oni!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.66,0:04:15.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti kalian terkejut disergap\Ndi area terpencil seperti ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.91,0:04:18.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebaiknya kalian bertekuk lutut\Ndan memohon agar tak kami bunuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.22,0:04:25.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski menyerah pun,\Nkalian para Oni akan tetap mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.93,0:04:30.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terutama kalian, Brigade Oni!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.73,0:04:32.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bajingan seperti kalian takkan kumaafkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.06,0:04:35.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian pikir para Oni\Nbisa berbuat seenaknya?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.01,0:04:38.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berapa banyak Momotaro yang kalian bunuh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.35,0:04:41.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga sama saja!\NBerapa banyak Oni yang kalian bunuh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.49,0:04:44.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Berapa banyak?\N- Kau tidak ingat jumlahnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Itu...\N- Tak bisa menjawab pertanyaanku?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.05,0:04:49.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Sedang ku...\N- Kau pikir tak perlu dijawab?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.70,0:04:51.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tutup dulu mulutmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.16,0:04:53.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Jangan menyela sebelum aku menjawab!\N- Jawab aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengarkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.32,0:04:56.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar aku bicara dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.90,0:05:01.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak sudi kuingat jumlah Oni yang kubunuh!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.09,0:05:05.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sendiri memangnya ingat\Njumlah nyamuk yang kau bunuh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.97,0:05:08.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu rupanya.\NJadi, kau tidak ingat, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.16,0:05:10.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak masalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.62,0:05:13.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Enma sang Raja Neraka\Nsedang menghitung dosa-dosamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.45,0:05:18.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau mau mati, majulah!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau mau hidup, menyerahlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.19,0:05:24.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kuempaskan kalian semua ke neraka!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.00,0:05:27.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial. Jumlah mereka cuma delapan orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.53,0:05:30.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka kelompok liar,\Ntak ada kaitannya dengan Agensi Oni.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.29,0:05:32.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak ada yang akan membantu mereka.\NJangan takut!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.03,0:05:35.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian semua!\NHujani mereka dengan peluru!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pelurunya berbalik arah?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.26,0:05:58.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau! Ketuanya! Hadapilah aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.06,0:06:00.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan meremehkan aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.81,0:06:06.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski bertugas di daerah terpencil,\Naku tetaplah Kapten di Agensi Momotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.79,0:06:10.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah kalian semua kubantai,\Njabatan di Tokyo telah menungguku.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.45,0:06:12.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, para prajuritku!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.15,0:06:15.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maju!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.17,0:06:27.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Abaikan saja! Maju terus!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teknik Gerhana Darah...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.09,0:06:31.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pedang Angin Bulan Berdarah!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.42,0:07:09.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka semua terempas.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.58,0:07:11.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa tidak masalah membiarkan sungainya\Ntersumbat begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.22,0:07:14.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar Uri yang mengurusnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.21,0:07:16.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa aku?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.31,0:07:18.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suruh Miyo pakai kekuatannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.45,0:07:20.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Laki-laki dilarang memandangiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.77,0:07:23.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata cuma gertak sambal.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.27,0:07:26.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masih ada yang tersangkut di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.65,0:07:35.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.32,0:07:36.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana anak buahku?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.99,0:07:38.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ke mana perginya mereka?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.24,0:07:41.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka tewas akibat embusan angin,\Nterpotong oleh tebasan,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.00,0:07:44.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,atau terlempar hingga tewas.\NSilakan pilih!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.96,0:07:47.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kekuatanku adalah angin.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.21,0:07:50.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kuselimuti tubuhku dengan angin\Ndan kukendalikan sesuka hati!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.80,0:07:52.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hentikan. Tunggu dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.84,0:07:53.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menyerah!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.26,0:07:56.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kumohon, jangan membunuhku!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.63,0:07:57.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menolaknya!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.39,0:08:04.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semboyan Brigade Oni adalah\Nmusnahkan semua Momotaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.52,0:08:10.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami akan menghabisi semua Momotaro\Ndari muka bumi!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.90,0:08:12.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jenderal!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.90,0:08:13.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.24,0:08:15.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saatnya kita pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.13,0:08:17.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian pergilah duluan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.02,0:08:19.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada orang yang harus kutemui.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.70,0:08:21.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Siapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.99,0:08:23.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ichinose Shiki!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.80,0:08:37.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,5.732.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.01,0:08:40.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,5.733.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.30,0:08:43.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tinggal 63 putaran.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.35,0:08:44.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.81,0:08:46.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berhenti mengeluh, Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.10,0:08:48.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tambah 10 putaran lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.48,0:08:49.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurang ajar!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.72,0:08:55.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa, Kepala Sekolah?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.20,0:09:03.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada tamu menarik yang ingin berkunjung,\Njadi kupersilakan mereka masuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.50,0:09:13.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, apa itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.93,0:09:20.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya itu kekuatan Oni, tetapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.18,0:09:36.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha? Apa katanya?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.07,0:09:39.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nyaris saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.11,0:09:43.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau muntah di atas burung hitamku,\Nakan kutendang kau!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.16,0:09:45.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Muntah di sana!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.54,0:09:51.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.21,0:09:53.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia gampang mabuk perjalanan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.42,0:09:57.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa mereka?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baru bertemu sudah muntah begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.64,0:10:00.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uri! Di mana kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.84,0:10:03.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa suaramu terdengar jauh sekali?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.60,0:10:06.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya ampun! Jangan meninggalkanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.47,0:10:07.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ke sana sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.56,0:10:09.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan bergerak sedikit pun!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.02,0:10:13.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemampuan navigasi Jenderal itu\Nbenar-benar payah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.06,0:10:15.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serius, mereka ini kenapa, sih?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.69,0:10:19.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, nikmatnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.32,0:10:23.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.78,0:10:27.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku datang tanpa sempat berkata,\N"Maaf mengganggu."
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seharusnya kau minta maaf\Nuntuk hal yang lain.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.08,0:10:32.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seragam itu.\NKalian Brigade Oni.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.92,0:10:34.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Brigade Oni?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.46,0:10:35.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.75,0:10:38.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku Todoroki Hayate, Jenderal Brigade Oni.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku Torikai Uri.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.76,0:10:44.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, bisa bertemu Mudano langsung.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.55,0:10:46.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu Brigade Oni?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.95,0:10:49.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka tampak seperti Unit Tempur.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.18,0:10:51.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Brigade Oni bukanlah sebuah unit\Nbentukan Agensi Oni.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.75,0:10:53.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka tak tergabung\Ndalam organisasi mana pun,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.62,0:10:56.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan menghancurkan pasukan Momotaro\Ndi mana pun mereka berada.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.48,0:10:57.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Betul sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.72,0:11:00.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tujuan kami adalah\Nmemusnahkan semua Momotaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.99,0:11:03.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami akan menghabisi semua Momotaro\Ndari muka bumi!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.74,0:11:05.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serius?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.82,0:11:09.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, ada perlu apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.09,0:11:12.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami dengar Ichinose Shiki ada di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.33,0:11:15.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh, itu aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.22,0:11:17.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, kau yang bernama Ichinose Shiki?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.38,0:11:20.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mewarisi kekuatan Kishin,\Nsama seperti aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.53,0:11:23.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga punya kekuatan Kishin?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.13,0:11:25.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.59,0:11:28.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menguasai angin.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.73,0:11:35.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kudengar kau menguasai api.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.40,0:11:37.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah api panas, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.81,0:11:39.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Tidak juga.\N- Kau tak kepanasan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.90,0:11:41.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Tidak, bukan...\N- Kenapa bajumu tidak terbakar?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.90,0:11:44.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diam dulu, biar aku jawab!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.15,0:11:45.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau tidak mau menjawabku?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.53,0:11:48.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kujawab kalau kau diam dulu!\NKau ini kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.95,0:11:50.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, untuk apa kau kemari?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.79,0:11:54.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ikutlah bersama kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.40,0:11:58.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ichinose Shiki, kami perlu kekuatanmu\Nsebagai Keturunan Kishin.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.92,0:12:00.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.52,0:12:05.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Agensi Oni sepertinya mencoba mencapai\Npenyelesaian damai melalui jalan kompromi.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.34,0:12:07.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, itu pola pikir yang naif!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.47,0:12:09.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau tidak berjuang,\Nmereka akan merampas hakmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.85,0:12:12.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika tak membunuh, kau yang akan dibunuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.56,0:12:16.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selama ada satu saja Momotaro yang hidup,\Nkelak mereka pasti kembali menyerang.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.60,0:12:18.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selama mereka masih hidup,\Nkebebasan sejati hanyalah angan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.94,0:12:20.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, pilihannya cuma satu:
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.02,0:12:23.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,membasmi seluruh keturunan Momotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.07,0:12:27.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kebebasan hanya menjadi milik mereka
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.72,0:12:30.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang bersedia memperjuangkannya\Ndan merebutnya dengan usaha sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.62,0:12:34.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari kita bersama-sama\Nmembasmi Momotaro dari muka bumi!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.56,0:12:37.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha? Tidak, terima kasih.\NJangan gampang terbawa emosi seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.04,0:12:38.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia langsung menolaknya tanpa ragu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.08,0:12:40.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah. Aku mengerti.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.29,0:12:41.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.42,0:12:42.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia menerimanya begitu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.13,0:12:44.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke, dah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.84,0:12:46.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat tinggal!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.38,0:12:47.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanya itu? Dia langsung pergi?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.59,0:12:49.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau yakin?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.89,0:12:51.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita sudah jauh-jauh kemari.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.47,0:12:55.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Idealisme yang ditanamkan secara paksa\Ntak akan pernah bisa berkembang.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.60,0:12:56.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita pergi!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.73,0:12:58.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berapa lama waktu perjalanan\Nke Air Terjun Kegon?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.71,0:13:02.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau terbang, sekitar 30 menit.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.48,0:13:04.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.07,0:13:06.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bawa aku bersamamu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.99,0:13:10.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi! Apa maksudmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.74,0:13:14.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kekuatanku tak bisa berkembang di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.49,0:13:18.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebaiknya aku ikut mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.37,0:13:23.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tujuanmu adalah membunuh Momotaro, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.25,0:13:25.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tujuan kita sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.01,0:13:27.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami sambut siapa pun yang mau bergabung.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.13,0:13:30.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kau serius?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.47,0:13:31.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lepaskan tanganmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.72,0:13:34.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada gunanya berdiam\Ndi tempat seperti ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.60,0:13:36.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teman-teman? Memelihara hati?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.18,0:13:37.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong kosong macam apa itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.89,0:13:39.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jijik aku mendengarnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.56,0:13:41.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sama sekali tidak berniat\Nberteman dengan kalian semua!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.98,0:13:43.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak sudi!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.09,0:13:49.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lebih baik mati daripada\Nberteman dengan orang seperti kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.09,0:13:54.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua waktuku terbuang di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.87,0:13:57.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pergi. Sampai nanti.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.65,0:13:59.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo berangkat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.01,0:14:01.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sadis juga kau, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.65,0:14:04.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Yaoroshi! Tunggu dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.51,0:14:10.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.78,0:14:32.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tak masalah pergi begitu saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.12,0:14:34.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah mereka teman-temanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.78,0:14:36.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.58,0:14:38.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita mau ke mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.57,0:14:41.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lokasi bekas Air Terjun Kegon\Ndi Prefektur Tochigi.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.33,0:14:42.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Air terjun?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.58,0:14:43.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau belum tahu?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.96,0:14:48.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rumornya, tempat itu ditutup\Nakibat munculnya gas beracun.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.63,0:14:50.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana aku tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.34,0:14:54.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Usut punya usut, di sana ada\Nlaboratorium Agensi Momotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.53,0:14:56.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya mereka sedang melakukan\Nberbagai macam eksperimen.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.97,0:14:58.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Hayate!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.46,0:15:00.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awas saja kalau kau muntah!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.73,0:15:05.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi benar-benar pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.53,0:15:07.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo kita kejar dia!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.11,0:15:09.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak perlu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.78,0:15:12.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia sudah menentukan pilihannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.61,0:15:14.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.74,0:15:16.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yusurube! Kau juga?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.20,0:15:20.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau dinilai dari tujuan yang dia sebutkan,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.33,0:15:24.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi mungkin lebih cocok\Nbergabung dengan Brigade Oni.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.25,0:15:30.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja, aku akan merindukannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.71,0:15:33.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi ini bukan sekolah biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.63,0:15:35.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita semua punya tujuan masing-masing.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.01,0:15:38.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, kalian semua tak sependapat?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.18,0:15:40.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa peduliku? Biarkan dia pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.67,0:15:46.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya tak pantas memaksanya tinggal\Nsetelah dia menentukan pilihannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana menurut Kakak?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.11,0:15:57.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau pikir selamanya\Nkita akan terus bergandengan tangan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.99,0:16:01.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau selalu mengatakannya\Ndengan nada seperti itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.62,0:16:03.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau kutata ucapanku agar lebih manis?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.62,0:16:04.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.84,0:16:06.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah, tenanglah.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.79,0:16:10.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Brigade Oni juga sedang bertempur\Nmelawan Momotaro, benar?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.71,0:16:11.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perjuangan kita berbeda.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.03,0:16:13.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.26,0:16:16.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Betul, ada Momotaro yang tak bisa kumaafkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.14,0:16:20.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu juga dengan kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.33,0:16:24.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku paham kalau duel maut harus terjadi\Nsaat kedua pihak ingin pertumpahan darah.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.89,0:16:27.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua tahu siapa pun bisa mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.77,0:16:29.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.26,0:16:33.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Muda-sen, ada juga Momotaro\Nyang tidak bertarung, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.28,0:16:37.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Di kalangan Momotaro\Njuga ada warga sipil
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan banyak Momotaro\Nyang tidak bergabung dengan Agensi
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.47,0:16:41.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang menjalani kehidupan normal.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.78,0:16:45.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Brigade Oni bilang kalau mereka\Nakan memusnahkan semua Momotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.41,0:16:52.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Artinya, Momotaro yang ingin hidup damai\Njuga akan ikut dihabisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.04,0:16:54.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian lihat sendiri di Kyoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.30,0:16:57.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Para Oni di sana hanya ingin hidup tenang.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.38,0:16:59.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, anak-anak itu dibunuh\Nhanya karena mereka keturunan Oni.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.64,0:17:03.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tegakah kalian meniru tindakan Tsubakiri?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.02,0:17:13.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Membunuh orang yang tak mau berperang\Nmerupakan tindakan yang keliru.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.07,0:17:17.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurasa Yaoroshi tidak mengerti hal itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.17,0:17:19.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu pun kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.07,0:17:23.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak bisa terima sebelum mendengar\Npenjelasan langsung dari Yaoroshi.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.04,0:17:27.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau dia paham semua itu\Ndan keputusannya tak berubah, silakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.58,0:17:29.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak akan mendukungnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.44,0:17:34.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, aku tak mau dia pergi begitu saja.\NAku pasti dihantui rasa bersalah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.00,0:17:37.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Muda-sen! Aku akan mengejarnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.97,0:17:40.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bilang kalau Oni\Nmemerlukan kehadiran teman, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.68,0:17:44.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berarti menghentikan seorang teman\Nagar tidak terjerumus ke jalan yang salah
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.37,0:17:45.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,juga sama pentingnya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.56,0:17:53.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kepala Sekolah, kami minta izin\Nuntuk pergi dari akademi.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.86,0:17:55.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengenai jumlah pesertanya...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.11,0:17:57.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga ikut!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.93,0:17:59.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak menyadarinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.28,0:18:01.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shiki benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.78,0:18:04.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Brigade Oni sedang berusaha\Nmelakukan hal yang sama dengan Tsubakiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.88,0:18:06.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita harus menghentikan mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.69,0:18:09.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tumben sekali kau berpikir secerdas itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.62,0:18:10.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kepalamu terbentur, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.66,0:18:12.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau bilang?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.33,0:18:15.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tadinya kupikir kita harus membiarkannya\Nkalau memang itu yang dia inginkan,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.91,0:18:17.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi mungkin kita harus menghentikannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.77,0:18:21.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha? Apa? Semua orang mau pergi?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.71,0:18:23.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau tinggal di sini saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.26,0:18:25.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kepalaku pusing.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.30,0:18:26.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan aku kehabisan napas.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.18,0:18:29.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pasti mengidap suatu penyakit.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.27,0:18:30.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau kelelahan karena barusan kita berlari.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.19,0:18:33.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kita mengejarnya,\Nkita pasti akan menemui masalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.51,0:18:34.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku takut!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.48,0:18:35.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, itu alasan sebenarnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.28,0:18:38.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, aku juga akan tinggal.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.61,0:18:41.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan selalu menjagamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.45,0:18:44.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak akan ada yang mengganggu kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.74,0:18:46.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,I-Itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.28,0:18:48.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi pergi dari akademi juga menakutkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.95,0:18:50.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Payah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, ayo kita berangkat!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.08,0:18:56.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ketika ada teman\Nyang menempuh jalan yang salah,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.59,0:18:58.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,pria sejati pasti menghentikannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.64,0:19:02.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan pakai Teknik Gerhana Darah\Nseenak jidat seperti itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.76,0:19:05.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau dia pergi, aku juga ikut!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.20,0:19:07.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi jangan sampai kau heboh!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.92,0:19:09.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya seru.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.52,0:19:11.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana?\NBerapa jumlah pesertanya?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.81,0:19:13.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jumlahnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.62,0:19:15.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah! Ayo kita lakukan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.19,0:19:16.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kubilang, jangan heboh!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.03,0:19:24.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.74,0:19:26.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Baiklah!\N- Tunggulah, Yaoroshi!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.23,0:19:29.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Ayo kita kejar si bodoh itu!\N- Kami menuju ke sana!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.59,0:19:39.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semoga Oni tidak menyerang markas kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.77,0:19:52.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anak-anak Oni memang mengagumkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.80,0:19:55.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Reaksi mereka jauh lebih baik\Nketimbang Oni dewasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.02,0:20:01.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari hasil eksperimen ini,\Naku pasti mendapatkan data menarik.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.44,0:20:05.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kau!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.74,0:20:07.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, Pak!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.68,0:20:09.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong buang mayat ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.62,0:20:10.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.66,0:20:17.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oni memang sangat menarik.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.25,0:20:19.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Banyak hal yang bisa dipelajari.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.42,0:20:23.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka sangat mirip dengan manusia,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.05,0:20:27.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,tetapi makin dibedah,\Nmakin banyak hal yang bisa ditemukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.97,0:20:31.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penelitianku juga akan segera tuntas.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.93,0:20:39.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, berapa subjek uji yang tersisa?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.56,0:20:40.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebentar.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.69,0:20:42.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,37 orang dewasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.70,0:20:45.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu tadi anak yang terakhir.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.15,0:20:49.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak cukup. Masih jauh dari kata cukup.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.20,0:20:51.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak peduli siapa pun korbannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.41,0:20:54.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ketua, ada yang bisa kubantu?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.29,0:20:56.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sedang senggang, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.73,0:20:58.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku memang sering senggang.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.88,0:21:00.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saking bosannya, kemampuanku mulai tumpul.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.08,0:21:04.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong carikan sejumlah subjek uji.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.14,0:21:07.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terutama anak-anak.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.42,0:21:09.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anak-anak yang sehat dan bersemangat.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.05,0:21:11.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.67,0:21:14.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada kediaman Oni di dekat sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.22,0:21:16.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malam nanti akan kutangkap mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.60,0:21:18.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.73,0:21:23.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tsubakiri memang luar biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.98,0:21:27.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah penelitian ini selesai,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.40,0:21:29.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,kami akan menyaksikan\Nsesuatu yang menakjubkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.22,0:21:35.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, kami masih perlu subjek uji.
